{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>TALPA</i>! Immerse yourself in the mind of a child during a school day, when fatigue transports them into a dreamlike world where <strong>reality and imagination</strong> merge. In this bizarre inner universe, the child falls asleep, and their brain transforms into a surreal battlefield filled with fascinating moles waiting to be hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/extras/Image2.png?t=1743934781\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your <strong>goal</strong> is simple but exciting: hit as many moles as you can with your hammer, aiming to achieve the highest score possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/extras/3def.png?t=1743934781\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be careful</strong> not to miss the moles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/extras/_STEAM_APP_IMAGE__Image1.png?t=1743934781\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover all the <strong>wonderful creatures</strong> that live in the game garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/extras/5def.png?t=1743934781\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't get distracted</strong> by anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/extras/4def.png?t=1743934781\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But there's a hidden twist! Discover the secret hammer that, deep inside the child's mind, transforms into the l<strong>egendary Mj\u00f6llnir</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/extras/6def.png?t=1743934781\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overcomes the <strong>night</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for a unique and fast-paced gaming experience where every shot counts in this epic clash between dream and reality!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585430?t=1743934781","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/ab53522a045eb80d7fdc87513aa3e4e8f270af72/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743934781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/2207327f9efd3a4e8015805273c930ecb4f79338/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743934781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/2207327f9efd3a4e8015805273c930ecb4f79338/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743934781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>TALPA</i>! Immerse yourself in the mind of a child during a school day, when fatigue transports them into a dreamlike world where <strong>reality and imagination</strong> merge. In this bizarre inner universe, the child falls asleep, and their brain transforms into a surreal battlefield filled with fascinating moles waiting to be hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/extras/Image2.png?t=1743934781\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your <strong>goal</strong> is simple but exciting: hit as many moles as you can with your hammer, aiming to achieve the highest score possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/extras/3def.png?t=1743934781\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be careful</strong> not to miss the moles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/extras/_STEAM_APP_IMAGE__Image1.png?t=1743934781\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover all the <strong>wonderful creatures</strong> that live in the game garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/extras/5def.png?t=1743934781\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't get distracted</strong> by anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/extras/4def.png?t=1743934781\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But there's a hidden twist! Discover the secret hammer that, deep inside the child's mind, transforms into the l<strong>egendary Mj\u00f6llnir</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/extras/6def.png?t=1743934781\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overcomes the <strong>night</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for a unique and fast-paced gaming experience where every shot counts in this epic clash between dream and reality!</p></li></ul>","developers":["TalpaGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585430/8e692e8c78078bab37f1e0abf2abce3104c5d84d/header.jpg?t=1743934781","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 TalpaGames. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nThe game Talpa, its logo, and all associated graphic materials are the exclusive property of Talp